=============================================================================
HOW TO CHANGE MICROSTEPPING SETTINGS
=============================================================================

Edit config.h and change these values:

#define SPINDLE_MICROSTEPS  8       // 8x for spindle (SPEED)
#define TRAVERSE_MICROSTEPS 16      // 16x for traverse (PRECISION)

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
SPINDLE MICROSTEPPING OPTIONS:
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Lower = Faster capable, less smooth
Higher = Slower max speed, smoother

Recommended values:
  4x  - Very fast (up to 600 RPM possible)
  8x  - Fast (up to 300 RPM) ← CURRENT DEFAULT
  16x - Medium (up to 150 RPM)
  32x - Slow (up to 75 RPM)

Current math with 8x:
  300 RPM × 8x = 4000 steps/second ✅

If you want FASTER:
  Use 4x: 600 RPM × 4x = 4000 steps/second

If you want SMOOTHER:
  Use 16x: 150 RPM × 16x = 4000 steps/second

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
TRAVERSE MICROSTEPPING OPTIONS:
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Keep at 16x for precision positioning!
(Traverse doesn't need high speed)

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
AFTER CHANGING:
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Save config.h
2. Rebuild:
   cd build
   make clean
   make -j4

3. Upload new firmware

4. Motors will auto-configure to new microstepping!

=============================================================================
